abstract: >-
  Python package for testing conditional associations between GWAS
  heritability and spatially informed ligand-receptor gene annotations. The
  primary analysis evaluates an aggregate annotation after baseline genomic
  and cell-intrinsic expression controls. A secondary analysis prioritizes
  directionless constituent-gene sets indexed by active ligand-receptor
  contexts; it does not identify a ligand-receptor interaction.
